{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-06-20 10:01:00', 'title': 'AIR INDIA FINALIZES ORDER FOR UP TO 290 BOEING SINGLE-AISLE AND WIDEBODY JETS', 'text': "LE BOURGET, FRANCE , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE:BA] AND AIR INDIA TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE FINALIZED AN ORDER FOR UP TO 290 NEW BOEING JETS AND EXPANDED SERVICES. AT THE 2023 PARIS AIR SHOW, THE COMPANIES HELD A SIGNING CEREMONY TO CELEBRATE THE HISTORIC PURCHASE OF BOEING'S MARKET-LEADING SINGLE-AISLE AND WIDEBODY JETS TO RENEW AND EXPAND AIR INDIA'S FLEET."}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-06-20 07:30:00', 'title': 'BOEING LAUNCHES SAF DASHBOARD TO TRACK AND PROJECT SUSTAINABLE AVIATION FUEL PRODUCTION', 'text': 'LE BOURGET, FRANCE , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE: BA] TODAY LAUNCHED SAF DASHBOARD, A TOOL THAT TRACKS EXPECTED SUSTAINABLE AVIATION FUEL (SAF) CAPACITY OVER THE NEXT DECADE. BASED ON DATA COLLECTED BY BLOOMBERGNEF, THE DASHBOARD AGGREGATES TOTAL SAF CAPACITY ANNOUNCEMENTS BY\xa0SUPPLIERS ON A GLOBAL SCALE AND CAN FILTER ANTICIPATED SUPPLY BY PRODUCTION PATHWAY, LOCATION AND OTHER METRICS.'}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-06-20 05:05:00', 'title': 'CHINA AIRLINES ANNOUNCES ORDER FOR EIGHT 787 DREAMLINERS AT PARIS AIR SHOW', 'text': "LE BOURGET, FRANCE , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE: BA] AND CHINA AIRLINES TODAY FINALIZED AN ORDER FOR EIGHT 787-9\xa0DREAMLINERS AT THE 2023 PARIS AIR SHOW. THIS FIRM ORDER, WHICH WAS PREVIOUSLY POSTED TO BOEING'S ORDERS AND DELIVERIES WEBSITE AS UNIDENTIFIED, FOLLOWS THE AIRLINE'S FIRST-EVER ORDER FOR 16 787-9S ANNOUNCED LAST YEAR."}